  "reference_protocol": "Both executables receive complete statements on separate input lines. Compare return codes, output, normalized diagnostics, persisted catalog/rows/rowids and integrity checks. Expected rows are never sorted or filtered to hide ordering differences.",
  "implementation_scope": "Lexically rewrite bound REFERENCES targets while retaining all other source characters. Table renames quote the parent name; column renames preserve input/target quoting. Each affected child source is parsed and checked against its unchanged Core schema by the existing catalog retention boundary. The connection invokes this before persistence with foreign_keys ON or OFF. Qualified main ALTER targets are normalized by lexical token structure, so quoted periods remain literal name characters.",
